'''Normal Cats''' (基本キャラ, ''Kihon Kyara'', '''Basic Characters''') are the first units the player unlocks as they progress through the game's opening saga, [[Empire of Cats]]. While they are the first cats the player gets, the group becomes a high-tier collection, and their higher (+) levels and [[True Form]]s, alongside their [[Crazed Cats (origin)|Crazed Cat]] counterparts make them necessary for many [[Legend Stages]]. The first nine Normal Cats gain their True Form after reaching level 20+10. Unlike other rarities, though, the player has to have beaten [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 2 and not Chapter 3 in order to gain access to their True Forms, likely due to them not requiring [[Catfruit]].

(+) levels are acquired from duplicate Normal Cats, obtained from [[Cat Capsule#Normal Cat Capsule|Normal Cat Capsules]]. All of the Normal Cats other than Cat, Tank Cat, Axe Cat and Gross Cat can also be obtained from the Normal Cat Capsule prior to being obtained from Empire of Cats.

The last Normal Cat, [[Superfeline (Normal Cat)|Superfeline]], is unlocked and upgraded a lot differently from the other nine, being unlocked from the Cat Capsule+, which is available after beating [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 3. Superfeline also has separate User Rank requirements for its level caps, alongside gaining its True Form after reaching level 20+80 instead of 20+10 like the other Normal Cats.

Normal Cat dupes will sell for 1 NP (2 after Cat Capsule+ is unlocked).

The list of Normal Cats includes:
*[[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] → Macho Cat → Mohawk Cat (''Unlocked from the beginning)''
*[[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]] → Wall Cat → Eraser Cat (''Complete [[Korea (Empire of Cats)|Korea]] Ch.1'')
*[[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cat]] → Brave Cat → Dark Cat (''Complete [[China (Empire of Cats)|China]] Ch.1'')
*[[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] → Sexy Legs Cat → Macho Leg Cat (''Complete [[Philippines (Empire of Cats)|Philippines]] Ch.1'')
*[[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] → Giraffe Cat → Lion Cat (''Complete [[Singapore (Empire of Cats)|Singapore]] Ch.1'')
*[[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cat]] → UFO Cat → The Flying Cat (''Complete [[Nepal (Empire of Cats)|Nepal]] Ch.1'')
*[[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Fish Cat]] → Whale Cat → Island Cat (''Complete [[Madagascar (Empire of Cats)|Madagascar]] Ch.1'')
*[[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Lizard Cat]] → Dragon Cat → King Dragon Cat (''Complete [[Egypt (Empire of Cats)|Egypt]] Ch.1'')
*[[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]] → Mythical Titan Cat → Jamiera Cat (''Complete [[Italy (Empire of Cats)|Italy]] Ch.1'')
*[[Superfeline (Normal Cat)|Superfeline]] → Superfeline II → True Superfeline (''Complete [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Ch.3'')

